      <description>&lt;h2 id=&#34;syntax&#34;&gt;Syntax&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;hunk-failed&#34;&gt;Hunk Failed&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-sh&#34; data-lang=&#34;sh&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;patching file lib/platform.c&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;Hunk &lt;span class=&#34;c1&#34;&gt;#1 FAILED at 266.&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;Hunk &lt;span class=&#34;c1&#34;&gt;#2 FAILED at 292.&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;m&#34;&gt;2&lt;/span&gt; out of &lt;span class=&#34;m&#34;&gt;2&lt;/span&gt; hunks FAILED -- saving rejects to file lib/platform.c.rej&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</description>
    </item>
